h3>套餐优惠</h3>\n<p>理发+染发组合，专享优惠价。</p>\n<p class=\"price\">300元</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<footer>\n版权所有 2025 悦容美发美容 · 广州市天河区体验路 18 号 · 电话 020-12345678\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: about.html  =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>关于我们 - 悦容美发美容</title>\n<style>\nbody {font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin:0; line-height:1.6; color:#333; background:#fafafa;}\n.container {max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px;}\nheader {text-align:center; padding:20px 0;}\n.logo {font-size:2.2em; margin-bottom:10px;}\nnav ul {list-style:none; display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:30px; margin:0; padding:0;}\nnav a {text-decoration:none; color:#0066cc; font-weight:500;}\nnav a:hover {color:#ff6600;}\n.hero {background:#f5f5f5; padding:60px 20px; text-align:center;}\n.hero h2 {margin-top:0; color:#333;}\n.hero p {font-size:1.1em; color:#555; margin-bottom:20px;}\n.cta {display:inline-block; background:#ff6600; color:#fff; padding:12px 24px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:bold;}\n.cta:hover {background:#e65c00;}\nfooter {text-align:center; padding:20px 0; font-size:0.9em; color:#777; margin-top:40px; border-top:1px solid #ddd;}\n.team-members {display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:30px; margin-top:20px;}\n.member {flex:1 1 250px; background:#fff; padding:15px; border:1px solid #ddd; border-radius:5px;}\n.member h3 {margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5px; color:#0066cc;}\n.member p {margin:0; color:#555;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header class=\"container\">\n<h1 class=\"logo\">悦容美发美容</h1>\n<nav>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"index.html\">首页</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"services.html\">服务</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"appointment.html\">预约</a></li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"hero container\">\n<h2>我们的团队</h2>\n<p>悦容美发美容拥有一支经验丰富、专业敬业的团队，致力于为每位顾客提供个性化的美容服务。</p>\n\n<div class=\"team-members\">\n<div class=\"member\">\n<h3>张华</h3>\n<p>资深发型师，拥有10年行业经验，专注于男士和女士的时尚切割与染发。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"member\">\n<h3>李娜</h3>\n<p>皮肤护理专家，擅长面部皮肤分析与定制护理方案，帮助顾客改善肤质。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"member\">\n<h3>王磊</h3>\n<p>美发教练，负责新人培训与技术交流，确保服务质量始终如一。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"member\">\n<h3>陈媛</h3>\n<p>美容顾问，提供个性化咨询与预约管理，让您的美容体验更贴心。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<footer>\n版权所有 2025 悦容美发美容 · 广州市天河区体验路 18 号 · 电话 020-12345678\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: appointment.html  =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>预约 - 悦容美发美容</title>\n<style>\nbody {font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin:0; line-height:1.6; color:#333; background:#fafafa;}\n.container {max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px;}\nheader {text-align:center; padding:20px 0;}\n.logo {font-size:2.2em; margin-bottom:10px;}\nnav ul {list-style:none; display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:30px; margin:0; padding:0;}\nnav a {text-decoration:none; color:#0066cc; font-weight:500;}\nnav a:hover {color:#ff6600;}\n.hero {background:#f5f5f5; padding:60px 20px; text-align:center;}\n.hero h2 {margin-top:0; color:#333;}\n.hero p {font-size:1.1em; color:#555; margin-bottom:20px;}\n.cta {display:inline-block; background:#ff6600; color:#fff; padding:12px 24px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:bold;}\n.cta:hover {background:#e65c00;}\nfooter {text-align:center; padding:20px 0; font-size:0.9em; color:#777; margin-top:40px; border-top:1px solid #ddd;}\nform {background:#fff; padding:20px; border:1px solid #ddd; border-radius:5px; max-width:600px; margin:0 auto;}\nform div {margin-bottom:15px;}\nform label {display:block; margin-bottom:5px; font-weight:500;}\nform input, form select, form textarea {width:100%; padding:8px; box-sizing:border-box; border:1px solid #ccc; border-radius:4px;}\nform button {background:#ff6600; color:#fff; padding:10px 20px; border:none; border-radius:4px; cursor:pointer; font-size:1em;}\nform button:hover {background:#e65c00;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header class=\"container\">\n<h1 class=\"logo\">悦容美发美容</h1>\n<nav>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"index.html\">首页</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"services.html\">服务</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a></li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"hero container\">\n<h2>在线预约</h2>\n<p>请填写以下信息，我们将在24小时内与您联系确认预约。</p>\n\n<form id=\"bookingForm\">\n<div>\n<label for=\"name\">姓名:</label><br>\n<input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required>\n</div>\n<div>\n<label for=\"phone\">手机号码:</label><br>\n<input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" required>\n</div>\n<div>\n<label for=\"service\">选择服务:</label><br>\n<select id=\"service\" name=\"service\" required>\n<option value=\"\">-- 请选择 --</option>\n<option value=\"理发\">精致理发</option>\n<option value=\"染发\">染发 (单色)</option>\n<option value=\"皮肤护理\">皮肤护理 (面部)</option>\n</select>\n</div>\n<div>\n<label for=\"date\">预约日期:</label><br>\n<input type=\"date\" id=\"date\" name=\"date\" required>\n</div>\n<div>\n<label for=\"time\">预约时间:</label><br>\n<input type=\"time\" id=\"time\" name=\"time\" required>\n</div>\n<div>\n<label for=\"remark\">备注 (可选):</label><br>\n<textarea id=\"remark\" name=\"remark\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<button type=\"submit\">提交预约</button>\n</div>\n</form>\n\n<script>\ndocument.getElementById('bookingForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {\ne.preventDefault();\nalert('感谢您的预约，我们将在24小时内与您联系！');\n});\n</script>\n</div>\n\n<footer>\n版权所有 2025 悦容美发美容 · 广州市天河区体验路 18 号 · 电话 020-12345678\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
